{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "3ac6da8766d0cc324f7876fe49d9ec590080acefe09a7d8180b8734e72169dfc", "ja": "From.遠くのあなた", "zh": "From.远方的你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b5a9629dd5b859eba8f91c07aba8f9b431886d58a43586478128f606f5fcd7e9", "ja": "ユニット活動が始まるも、やはりメンバー達\nは忙しく、揃ってのレッスンどころか顔合わ\nせの機会もない。プロデューサーはオンライ\nン通話でのミーティングを提案、まず朋花と\n可憐が通話し、手ごたえを掴むのだった。", "zh": "虽然组合活动开始了，但成员们果然都很忙，别说一起上课了，连见面的机会都没有。制作人提议通过在线通话开会，先让朋花和可怜进行通话，没想到还真摸索出了一些门道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a33fb3712d79916316093060774d79e9dd641d88200171a6ca65b2a8c62a91b7", "ja": "（朋花、千鶴さん、可憐のユニット『ピスケス』が\n動き出した。俺もスケジュール調整、頑張らないとな）", "zh": "（朋花、千鹤小姐和可怜的组合『双鱼座』开始行动了。我也得努力调整日程才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "c3da6a731adf5289051f1d0e2075f761e8d3e4148591f0c486ca60b1a5d3d107", "ja": "では、わたくしは大学に行ってから、そのまま\n撮影スタジオに向かってしまいますわね。", "zh": "那么，我会先去大学，然后直接前往摄影棚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "472a73cfe2fd3b19c756951913d39eb5fd9c4d461314c52281159f577a214281", "ja": "撮影が長引いたら、今日は劇場には\n戻ってこられないかもしれませんが……。", "zh": "如果拍摄拖得太久，今天可能就没法回剧场了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a42786ca4446735e8ba9fc6d6f054d6f3c3c2bd32b56dc4079723a027f1dc42b", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、仕事が終わったら連絡だけください。\n無理はしないでくださいね。", "zh": "没事的，等工作结束后跟我联系一下就好。\n别太勉强自己哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "de2bb805f3014546ecdbe73254fc15b04979fe5441bb8382a7aa2536f1809cac", "ja": "わかりましたわ！　それでは、行ってまいりますわね。\nふたりによろしく言っておいてくださいまし。", "zh": "我明白了！那么，我这就出发了。\n请代我向她们两位问个好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2ebeaef088199a4771a18c07eeab620753fc0496d2c0de57204709388644a237", "ja": "（可憐は早朝からロケ、千鶴さんも隙間時間は\nなさそうだ。さて、朋花のほうは……）", "zh": "（可怜一大早就去外景拍摄了，千鹤小姐似乎也没有空闲时间。那么，朋花那边呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "aec2bb37b4cd2f5bced3cbd9f02d78b9dbb0b952584474da2908fe4297a4d1fe", "ja": "あれ？　朋花、もう来てたのか。\n千鶴さんとちょうど入れ違いだったな……。", "zh": "哎？朋花，你已经到了啊。\n刚好跟千鹤小姐错过了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "f39fc2f6c316996f1929be90efd55c7718eaa255b407f4669fc8fa3e9078cf86", "ja": "千鶴さんもお忙しいのですから、\n呼び止めるのも失礼かと～。", "zh": "毕竟千鹤也很忙，特意叫住她也不太礼貌～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e60f65e579627821357515c44916f3c79cfef22f29fb8b1bab34c12e601741b2", "ja": "そうだな……。朋花も今日はレッスンの合間に\n取材対応があったりするけど……頑張ろう！", "zh": "是啊……朋花今天也要在课程间隙接受采访什么的……一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "f4870c87210a26e85c52b0ec23fb1db36aeede6377bc55c13282653382f8aadc", "ja": "ええ、言われるまでもありません～。", "zh": "是的，不用您说我也知道～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "a881ef156d88afb825f6b4be7b37018a0653fc5ba454492f9ca1ebe55cc7b1e7", "ja": "……。それで、{$P$}さんは、\n私のレッスンをのんびり見ているだけですか～？", "zh": "……。那么，{$P$}先生就只是\n悠闲地看着我练习而已吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ac37cd6bec954d13eaefaa223227013962cfb982665cf8be30042cc4080a0c9a", "ja": "いや、やれることはやってるぞ。\nあちこち連絡を取って調整してるし……。", "zh": "没有，我该做的事情都有在做哦。\n到处联络做协调什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f5c7ca5073fca67c2cacc13d256fbb807089ac79dc23e17adbbf6ac7f29d0716", "ja": "それに、秘密兵器も用意したんだ。\n朋花のレッスンが終わった後、試してみたい。", "zh": "而且，我还准备了秘密武器。\n等朋花的训练结束后，想试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "7ae042d7fc6fd9a27a2ffaf9b76ea34772efe2e3b3f175504eba6c898c3e9b82", "ja": "秘密兵器～？", "zh": "秘密武器～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1014_null", "source_sha256": "4a23a15b4952ecca0c082165cae26ae8505ba6a91b6e96796d2f8fd1c6a52432", "ja": "そしてレッスン後……", "zh": "然后在训练之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "86b175cf94dc23700304aa863adf2777f1ea59a47010b221a6eb88abed9a2125", "ja": "{$P$}さん、秘密兵器とは\nそのパソコンのことですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您说的秘密武器\n是指那台电脑吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "26007020b59830f3ff5bf778941c8438b4f35f6472ebf3682a57ef48e9ea2c9c", "ja": "ああ。ロケ先のホテルにいる可憐と、オンライン通話を\nしようと思うんだ。設定をこうして……お、映ったぞ！", "zh": "嗯，我想和在外景地酒店里的可怜进行视频通话。把设置调成这样……哦，画面出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "a4d8bd4d1c9a4e3b3a208d069fde98875d5f61324defd7b66529fb043cdce956", "ja": "画面に可憐さんが映っていますが……\n声が聞こえませんね～。", "zh": "画面上能看到可怜小姐，但是……\n听不到声音呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c5df1fee97e8b7207e5b607c3dbb230a2d5dbc61d788232ae555fda8182657fd", "ja": "マイクを認識してないのかも。\n一旦、チャットで連絡してみるか……。", "zh": "可能是没有识别到麦克风。\n要不要先在聊天里联系一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1044_null", "source_sha256": "aab3ced10516c9a158c8e000f40ce1f6301d8bfb8f679d8deac488cc17947a52", "ja": "カチャカチャ。…………。", "zh": "咔哒咔哒。…………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "059c338dfe57d1c69f365ad90e010bc6f381d4e39575128d80cba1683e80c44a", "ja": "これで、大丈夫ですか……？　聞こえてますか……？", "zh": "这样就可以了吗……？能听见吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "04e67c039074491569e119e6108dac7022170d82080149225fda07f1b5cd8398", "ja": "大丈夫だ。聞こえてるぞ。\nこれで問題なさそうだな。", "zh": "没问题。听得见。\n这样看来应该没什么问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "133c025962d239889d2b253c4a610dbbf57a68314501adef0a3d3c626af1e9ee", "ja": "わ、劇場の控室が見える……♪　朋花ちゃんも、\n{$P$}さんも……♪", "zh": "哇，能看到剧场的休息室呢……♪　朋花也在，\n{$P$}先生也是……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "ecf58fa8dfd797dee06b3a75de0ac60256695c214321245fab6c9fa6f8208fa5", "ja": "こちらからも可憐さんが見えますよ～。\nオンライン通話って、こんな感じなんですね～。", "zh": "从这边也能看到可怜小姐哦～  \n原来在线视频通话是这种感觉啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "4a918f0e2aeddafefc85d5127f2d5f3eadb3b133c0f672fd9cbc351b0e4bd1fa", "ja": "結構きれいに映るな。3人集まれなくても、これなら\n振り付けの簡単な確認とかできるんじゃないか。", "zh": "画面还挺清楚的嘛。就算不能凑齐3个人，这样一来，也能简单确认一下舞蹈动作之类的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "3abca630b3431949dec643622d376cd4ab059702020049fd7218fb92801fa1fb", "ja": "なるほど～。{$P$}さんに\nしては、悪くないアイディアですね～。", "zh": "原来如此～。就{$P$}先生而言，这个主意还不错呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "dafb6ec18b63796b3e78e291d7edd55b064eac3bdb067d5f4e90ddc0e45212e9", "ja": "わ、私も素敵なアイディアだと思います♪\n千鶴さんがいないのが、残念ですけど……。", "zh": "我、我也觉得是个很棒的想法♪\n虽然千鹤小姐不在，有点遗憾就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "66bf766733605d3b7bc05e0cd8c19e4e969334faa5b980b98f3253a69a1312ea", "ja": "そうですね～。では、千鶴さん参加回のため、\n私達でいろいろテストしておきましょう～。", "zh": "是啊～那么，为了千鹤参加的那一回，我们先来测试各种各样的东西吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "0666930aa1ecdc76c8b0324889e8314b37345a1b8294820421c92806ecb1e593", "ja": "そ、そっか……そうだね……♪\nそれじゃあ……その……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……确实呢……♪\n那么……那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "2777169a16228b50baa1ad27a86375ef07db5d313ff984abe95f07f1d8e58778", "ja": "なんだか、画面越しだと……き、緊張しちゃうね……？\nいつもは普通に、おしゃべりしてるのに……。", "zh": "总觉得隔着屏幕说话……会、会让人紧张呢……？\n明明平时都能很自然地聊天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "3a782f8b7ccd77795165a00f178021204c4eebad5c0d2720ef5c78b2fe234d95", "ja": "うふふ♪　ではまず、お仕事の報告から\n入るのはどうでしょう～？", "zh": "呵呵♪　那不如先从汇报工作\n开始，大家觉得怎么样～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "035e495c0d7de66a8b9e36a8c4e9c94c3f3c75be16e55a3cd9d95d8b8d1ac626", "ja": "う、うん。えっと、私は山で撮影してて……\nちょっと、ロープウェイが怖かったけど……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。那个，我去山里拍摄了……\n虽然缆车稍微有点可怕就是了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "8c402db8b62c244dba28c0b709095d396fd6ecca8e6298996ddaf0977e6b905a", "ja": "すごく景色がいい場所だったから、み、みんなと\n一緒に来れたらなぁって、思ってたんだ……♪", "zh": "因为那里景色特别美，所以我一直在想，要是能和、和大家一起来就好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "4205c25cde4af5a19bddc3fa2923a6dd8f9b9188ea5ff4e9dac866f1d410d776", "ja": "あっ、写真撮ってくるの、忘れちゃった……。\n明日、ぜ、絶対撮ってくるね……♪", "zh": "啊，我忘了拍照片回来……\n明天我一、一定会拍回来的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1034_031tom", "source_sha256": "79b056b995c4af064e5f4565655fdaba9928e8863f001a5e5bb1790ad14ce496", "ja": "うふふ、楽しみにしておきますね～♪\n私はダンスレッスンを進めましたよ～。", "zh": "呵呵，我很期待哦～♪\n我这边舞蹈练习也有了进展呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1035_045kar", "source_sha256": "fdbd14193db0acc364eae1e18c734b63d03b70f69730a00d3c53b8310ae0f1df", "ja": "あ、そっか。わ、私もユニットの仕事の\n進捗を話さなくちゃだよね……！", "zh": "啊，对了。我、我也得说说组合工作的进展才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1036_045kar", "source_sha256": "d9dbe4fb827cb40cd027f616683c0c58ce8a6f8dc44e7e9e8af35542a58cf11e", "ja": "ええと、歌詞は少しづつ覚えてて……あ！\nステップの位置が、つ、掴めないところがあって……。", "zh": "那个……歌词我正在一点点记……啊！\n还有些舞步的位置，我、我还掌握不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "120c744ba725478ada2fef8ab61e25c47fa94e77d7c285e27b57d117ec3c3c32", "ja": "そろそろ時間かな……この辺で切り上げようか。\nすり合わせ、結構できたんじゃないかな？", "zh": "差不多到时间了吧……我们先练到这里，收尾吧。\n感觉已经磨合得差不多了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1038_031tom", "source_sha256": "808e8bc5a43bd22a50dea51259d481db2d92122ac138ae50f178063941541343", "ja": "はい～。文章や電話よりも、動きの\n具体的なやりとりが出来たかと思いますね～。", "zh": "是啊～我觉得比起文字或电话，这样能更具体地交流动作呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1039_045kar", "source_sha256": "a777387bc8fe3f6ef19a04698844856082a79ee0cca44ecebe523effe82d20c0", "ja": "うん……♪　それに……会えないはずの人の顔が\n見れただけでも、う、嬉しかったな……♪", "zh": "嗯……♪　而且……光是能看到\n本以为见不到的人的脸，就、就很高兴了呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1040_045kar", "source_sha256": "1c7341037eeb47ed458474e963e054b43d08f96096355b2b2ce8101992a62116", "ja": "スケジュール大変だけど、\nが、頑張ろうね……！　朋花ちゃん……！", "zh": "日程虽然很紧张，但、但我们一起加油吧……！朋花……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1041_031tom", "source_sha256": "eeeb7cc693b862ac40c8d60e442e7aa2431109b56fad54eae0ae555d69691b32", "ja": "ええ、もちろんです～♪　\nそれでは、これで失礼しますね～。", "zh": "嗯，当然啦～♪\n那么，就先告辞了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "673e6bdf4bf803968f21f4b0aa71b7c92a8e60ea5c9d62e197800a964b408699", "ja": "（ふたりの感触は悪くなかった。実際、ダンスの\n疑問は映像のおかげで解消されたみたいだし……）", "zh": "（两人的感觉不坏。实际上，舞蹈方面的疑问似乎也多亏了视频得到了解决……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_02_1043_p", "source_sha256": "813c93d6cf948a9c23300f77eaf98c33a77592fdfa404928b73172ed1c21ae4c", "ja": "（オンラインでのミーティング、有効みたい\nだな。色々試しながら、運用していこう）", "zh": "（看来在线会议确实挺有效的。之后就一边尝试各种方法，一边运作下去吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
